+| lenovo-tb128xu_stlb_cool | back | false | 32.8 FAIL | 28.6 FAIL | 34.3 FAIL | 23.3 FAIL |
+
+Per-face shading for the deciding holds (top / left side / right side, against the group's recorder calibration):
+`stla warm` hold 1 −2.8 / −27.0 / +16.2; `stka cool` hold 1 −1.6 / −25.6 / −16.8; `stkb cool` hold 1 +10.0 / −13.4 /
+−12.7.
